<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-VE">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verificación de Credencial Laboral — {{ instanceName | default("TalentoVe") }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: {{ primaryColor | default("#0d47a1") }};
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --success: #16a34a;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .credential-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      max-width: 440px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);
      overflow: hidden;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .credential-header {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .gov-flag { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .org-title { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; opacity: 0.9; }
    .credential-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #15803d;
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }
    .credential-body { padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem; }
    .avatar-circle {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: -3.5rem;
      border: 4px solid var(--card-bg);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .worker-name { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 0.75rem; color: var(--text); }
    .worker-ci { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .info-grid {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .info-label { font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; }
    .info-value { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); margin-top: 0.15rem; }
    .token-hash {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      word-break: break-all;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 0.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .footer-note { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.4; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="credential-card">
    <div class="credential-header">
      <div class="gov-flag">🇻🇪</div>
      <div class="org-title">{{ institutionName | default("República Bolivariana de Venezuela") }}</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.8;">Sistema de Identificación y Registro Laboral</div>
      <div class="credential-badge">
        <span>✓</span>
        <span>CREDENCIAL ACTIVA Y VERIFICADA</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="credential-body">
      <div class="avatar-circle">
        {{ worker.nombres | truncate(1, true, "") | upper }}{{ worker.apellidos | truncate(1, true, "") | upper }}
      </div>

      <h2 class="worker-name">{{ worker.nombres }} {{ worker.apellidos }}</h2>
      <div class="worker-ci">{{ worker.cedulaTipo }}-{{ worker.cedulaNumero }}</div>

      <div class="info-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="info-label">Cargo</div>
          <div class="info-value">{{ worker.cargo | default("Funcionario / Empleado") }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="info-label">Departamento</div>
          <div class="info-value">{{ worker.departamento | default("Sede Principal") }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="info-label">Fecha Ingreso</div>
          <div class="info-value">{{ worker.fechaIngreso }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="info-label">Estatus</div>
          <div class="info-value" style="color: var(--success);">{{ worker.status | default("ACTIVO") | upper }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-label" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Huella Digital Criptográfica (SHA-256):</div>
      <div class="token-hash">{{ verificationHash }}</div>

      <p class="footer-note">
        Esta credencial ha sido validada en tiempo real contra la base de datos oficial de {{ instanceName | default("TalentoVe") }}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
